{"games":[{"id":394773622,"name":"REVENGE OF THE SLIMES!!!","desc":"This is a recreated slime survival game inspired by:\nJustinP231's\n -<[ATTACK OF THE SLIMES: BUILD TO SURVIVE!!!]>- \nhttps://www.roblox.com/games/1845318/\n\nThis was created so that we can still enjoy the game that was created in 2008!\n\nFor those who have never tried JustinP231's game, note that this game has strayed significantly from the classic. However, the game will still give a good representation on how the classic version went.\n\nBoss waves:\nWizard: 5, King Slime: 10, Ancient Giant: 15, Slime Army General's Tank: 20, Space fleet: 25.\n\nLiked the game? Don't forget to leave a Thumbs Up(👍) and Favorite(🌟) . Thank you!\n\nJoin the group for a FREE member label and game perks!\n\nGroup Perks:\n✨Member✨\n--- +25% Walk Speed!\n💫Mega Member💫\n--- Extra Bomb Each Round!\n--- +25% Walk Speed!\n🌟Royal Member🌟\n--- Circle Wall Tool!\n--- Extra Bomb Each Round!\n--- +25% Walk Speed!","path":"/game/394773622-revenge-of-the-slimes","slug":"394773622-revenge-of-the-slimes","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/528166d81dc40b54b925b491348d0bd1cb30af8664f9ac8d334852dfef6a62b5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bdd6a17fd95cc9e9f41bf04c1968467f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":82393037,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-24T11:40:53.733Z","creator":{"name":"Chillz Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6281183,"name":"The Longest Hole In Roblox","desc":"☁ Can you fly to the top of the longest hole in ROBLOX?\n\n✎ Want a boost? Have a look at the shop\n\nDon't forget to thumbs up and favourite! Thank you!\n\nClick the bell for notifications on updates/events! 🔔","path":"/game/6281183-the-longest-hole-in-roblox","slug":"6281183-the-longest-hole-in-roblox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2c3b97059ca3d79b11e31ea408734036dcaa19a6eda23a612acf477a3ce9b1da.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY